WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Grace Liu: PM compliance on Line 2 dropped to eighty-six percent this month, mostly missed lubrication checks.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Theo Marsh: What's causing the lubrication checks to slip?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Grace Liu: Weekend shift coverage has been thin, those checks keep getting deferred.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Carlos Ibarra: Let's see if we can shift that task to the weekday shift schedule instead.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Grace Liu: I'll update the PM schedule and track compliance again next month.
